      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIWI EVOCA (4) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his superb win the start prior, getting around The Meadows over 525m in 29.87. Looks the one to beat on win two back. KIWI HANK (2) was unwanted in betting but burnt to an early lead and scored an all the way win over 525m at The Meadows in Mix 6/7, scoring by 1.1 lengths (30.14). Fast beginner who should quickly stride to the lead. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. BLOWING TRUMPETS (1) scored two back in quick then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 5.5 lengths 6th at this track (30.32). In the mix. BREACH (3) is a course and distance winner who cannot be left out.",
